# Rules for AI Agents — Market E-commerce Project

## Project Structure
- `/backend` — NestJS 12 API (Node.js, TypeORM, PostgreSQL, JWT Auth)
- `/frontend` — Angular 20 App (Tailwind CSS, Playwright E2E, PWA)
- `/docs/ER.md` — Database Entity-Relationship diagram
- `/frontend/AGENTS.md` — Frontend-specific design system & agent rules

## Before Starting Any Task
1. Read `/frontend/AGENTS.md` for design system tokens and conventions.
2. Read `/frontend/DESIGN.md` for the complete Uber-inspired style reference.
3. Ensure you understand the tech stack: Angular 20 standalone + Signals, NestJS 12 ESM, TypeORM, PostgreSQL.

## Design System Compliance (Frontend)
- **Font:** Inter (primary), system-ui fallback.
- **Colors:** Only use documented CSS tokens (`--color-primary`, `--color-canvas`, etc.). No arbitrary colors.
- **Buttons:** Pill shape (`border-radius: 999px`) unless explicitly documented otherwise.
- **Spacing:** Use the token scale (`--spacing-md`, `--spacing-lg`, etc.).
- **Max content width:** 1200px.

## E2E Testing with Playwright (Mandatory)
### When to write/update tests
- Every new page or feature must include at least one E2E test.
- Any UI change that affects user flows (auth, cart, checkout) requires test updates.
- Use `data-testid` selectors only. Never use CSS classes or XPath.

### How to run tests
```bash
cd frontend
npm run e2e          # Run all tests headless
npm run e2e:ui       # Run with UI for debugging
npm run e2e:report   # Open HTML report
```

### Agent verification protocol
Before marking any frontend task as complete:
1. Run `npm run e2e`.
2. If tests fail, fix them before completing the task.
3. If the change is visual, run `npm run e2e:ui` and manually validate screenshots.
4. Ensure tests pass on both Chromium and Mobile Chrome projects.

## Backend Rules
- NestJS uses ESM (`"type": "module"`). Imports must include `.js` extensions.
- Entities are in `src/database/entities/`.
- No circular imports between entities (causes runtime errors in ESM).
- Always run `npm run build` after backend changes to verify TypeScript.

## Tech Stack Summary
| Layer | Tech |
|-------|------|
| Frontend Framework | Angular 20 (standalone, signals, new control flow) |
| Frontend Styling | Tailwind CSS 4 + custom design tokens |
| Frontend E2E | Playwright (Chromium + Mobile Chrome) |
| Frontend PWA | @angular/pwa (Service Worker) |
| Backend Framework | NestJS 12 |
| Backend ORM | TypeORM 0.3 |
| Database | PostgreSQL 16+ |
| Auth | JWT (Passport) |
| API Docs | Swagger/OpenAPI at `/api/docs` |

## Local Development URLs
- Frontend: `http://localhost:4200`
- Backend API: `http://localhost:3000/api`
- Swagger Docs: `http://localhost:3000/api/docs`

